# NOTE: harness artifacts (TASK.md, CHANGES.diff, ccc-report.md, ccc-runfacts.json,
# ccc-forge.json, events.jsonl) are deliberately NOT listed here.
#
# Isolation uses `git worktree`, so a worktree inherits this file. The loop stages with
#   git add -A -- . :(exclude)TASK.md :(exclude)events.jsonl ...
# and git fails that command outright when the pathspec matches ignored paths:
#   "The following paths are ignored by one of your .gitignore files"
# which is a non-zero exit, so diffText throws and the run dies after a green gate.
#
# The pathspec exclusion in src/run.js (HARNESS_ARTIFACTS) is the mechanism that keeps
# these files out of CHANGES.diff. Ignoring them here does not add safety — it breaks the
# mechanism. If one ever leaks into this tree, `git status` showing it is the desired
# outcome, not something to suppress.

# Test scratch directories, if a test ever creates one in-tree.
.ccc-test-*/

# Local editor / tool state.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Node — this package has zero runtime dependencies and no build step, but a stray
# install should not be committed.
node_modules/
